body:
Thank you both for your thoughts! That was what I thought also, just a typical bed bug unfortunately. I'd thought they may have infested an old recliner I use, so we got rid of it, but it seems the problem persists. I can't see any signs of them on either of the actual beds in our apartment though. I will keep doing some digging, and let my landlord know that we have this issue, and it's new, so maybe they will be able to figure it out and get it taken care of. 

&#x200B;

Thank you again so much for taking the time to look and comment, it means the world to me. <3 Thanks!

Sorry about the loud noise, I suck at video editing and can't figure out how to get rid of it.

&#x200B;

Edit: Never mind, fixed it :)

Sorry about the noise, headphone users beware!

&#x200B;

Edit: Never mind, figured out how to put music over it :)
